 Problem: The trendlines, horizontal levels, and other technical drawings made on the charts do not save reliably. They frequently vanish simply by refreshing the page or switching timeframes/tabs.
 Technical trading relies entirely on continuous price action mapping, support, and resistance zones. Having hours of analysis wiped out mid-session ruins workflow, wastes critical time during live market hours, and introduces avoidable execution risks.
Trading is a game of precision and speed. Losing saved chart layouts defeats the purpose of advanced charting tools. Please look into this synchronization or saving bug on Kite''s chart engine as a priority.', 'unknown', 'en', NULL, 'f173c21a8a719e38d4da5bce36074d77ff146272dbae096248ec33a7941970ed', 'NORMALIZED', 'CLEAN', 'IN', '3.11.12', 2, '2026-10-30 09:18:54', NULL, '2026-11-06 16:11:43', NULL, NULL, 'ELIGIBLE', '1.0.0', '2027-11-06 16:11:43', 'ACTIVE', '2026-11-06 16:11:43', 'I really appreciate the overall performance of the Kite app and web platform. The integration of advanced charts has been a game-changer. However, I am facing a persistent and frustrating issue that severely impacts daily trading.
