Update -August 2026
My NRI friends, beware you are not allowed to invest into DIRECT mutual funds from this platform

———

The app may look polished, but the onboarding experience for NRIs is shockingly bad.
I have been stuck for over a month dealing with support tickets because their KYC team seems to have little to no understanding of the NRI KYC process. My Indian passport was renewed at an Indian Embassy abroad and clearly carries my foreign address, which is completely valid and standard for NRIs. Despite this, the document was repeatedly rejected without any proper explanation.
Instead of helping resolve the issue, support staff kept giving random excuses just to close tickets, with no real guidance or escalation. There was no sense of ownership or competence — interactions felt more like dealing with an outdated government office than a modern digital platform.', 'unknown', 'en', NULL, '114540fae505e56c68618333f7e18122d2d8cad09711b10890040805316c08e5', 'NORMALIZED', 'CLEAN', 'IN', '6.8.0', 1, '2026-08-09 07:03:35', NULL, '2026-11-06 16:12:17', NULL, NULL, 'ELIGIBLE', '1.0.0', '2027-11-06 16:12:17', 'ACTIVE', '2026-11-06 16:12:17', 'Latest Update: Its been 6 months to complete NRI KYC, even when all documents are provided, NO DIRECT mutual funds for NRI

