losses. Angel One seriously needs to improve its research team, the accuracy of its trading calls, and its notification system. Customers trust your recommendations with their hard-earned money, but the experience has been very disappointing. Please do not make trading just a way to earn brokerage and revenue. Think about your customers too. We invest our money based on the trust we place in your platform. A good trading service should focus on quality research, realistic targets, proper risk management, timely notifications, and customer satisfaction. Please improve your research quality and take your customers’ financial losses seriously. Customers deserve better than repeated stop-loss hits and missed targets.', 'unknown', 'mixed', NULL, '385aa221f8bc629c92509795630e4a80d4491545fd1f133214b00d8e9b0e82b7', 'NORMALIZED', 'CLEAN', 'IN', '226.10.2', 1, '2026-10-29 07:47:08', NULL, '2026-11-06 16:12:05', NULL, NULL, 'ELIGIBLE', '1.0.0', '2027-11-06 16:12:05', 'ACTIVE', '2026-11-06 16:12:05', 'I am extremely disappointed with Angel One’s trading calls. Out of nearly 90 trade calls, I have experienced huge losses or stop-loss hits, and so far, I have not seen even a single call achieve its target. Many times, trades are exited before reaching the target, and sometimes important exit notifications are not received on time, resulting in avoidable losses. Angel One seriously needs to improve its research team, the accuracy of its trading calls, and its notification system. Customers trust your recommendations with their hard-earned money, but the experience has been very disappointing. Please do not make trading just a way to earn brokerage and revenue. Think about your customers too. We invest our money based on the trust we place in your platform. A good trading service should focus on quality research, realistic targets, proper risk management, timely notifications, and customer satisfaction. Please improve your research quality and take your customers’ financial losses 